This product includes a TypeScript translation of the VocalTract LaTeX
package (CTAN pkg/vocaltract, release 1, 2012) by Dimitrios Ververidis,
in src/lib/platform/vocal-tract/ and its copy in
mobile/src/platform/vocal-tract/.

  D. Ververidis, D. Schneider and J. Koehler, "The vocal tract LaTeX
  package", The PracTeX Journal, 2012, no. 1.
  https://ctan.org/pkg/vocaltract

The package README licenses it under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0); the header of VocalTract.sty
names the LaTeX Project Public License
(https://www.latex-project.org/lppl/). These files are a modified version:
the TeX macros were translated to TypeScript, the drawing was cropped to the
head and regrouped into named layers, and a front lip view, interpolation and
a parameter fit were added. They are not the original package and do not
carry its file names.

The model's factor-analysis loadings are from S. Maeda, "Compensatory
articulation during speech: evidence from the analysis and synthesis of
vocal-tract shapes using an articulatory model", in W. J. Hardcastle and
A. Marchal (eds.), Speech Production and Speech Modelling, Kluwer, 1990.
